  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "しっぽを　ふって　はつでんする。きけんを　かんじると　あたまを　てんめつさせてなかまに　つたえる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꼬리를 흔들어서 전기를 발생시킨다. 위험을 감지하면 머리를 깜빡여서 동료에게 알린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會搖尾巴來發電。感覺到有危險時，會閃爍頭部通知夥伴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon produit de l’électricité en agitant sa queue. Lorsqu’il perçoit un danger, sa tête clignote pour avertir ses congénères.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es erzeugt Strom, indem es mit seinem Schwanz wedelt. Bei Gefahr warnt es seine Artgenossen, indem es seinen Kopf aufblinken lässt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Produce electricidad agitando la cola. Si siente peligro, hace parpadear su cabeza para alertar a sus compañeros.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Genera energia elettrica muovendo la coda. Se percepisce un pericolo fa lampeggiare la testa per avvisare i suoi simili.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tadbulb shakes its tail to generate electricity. If it senses danger, it will make its head blink on and off to alert its allies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尻尾を　振って　発電する。危険を　感じると　頭を　点滅させて仲間に　伝える。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "通过摇晃尾巴来发电。若感知到有危险，会闪烁头部来通知伙伴。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Produce electricidad agitando la cola. Si siente peligro, hace parpadear su cabeza para alertar a sus compañeros.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだに　たくわえた　でんりょくで　ふゆうする。らいうんのときは　いつもよりたかく　うきあがるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸에 비축된 전력으로 부유한다. 뇌운이 있을 때는 평소보다 높게 떠오른다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用蓄積在體內的電力浮在空中。出現雷雲時則能浮得比平時還要高。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il flotte dans les airs grâce à l’électricité emmagasinée dans son corps. Les jours d’orage, il lévite un peu plus haut qu’à l’accoutumée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Durch den in seinem Körper gespeicherten Strom kann es schweben. Bei Gewittern schwebt es höher über dem Boden als gewöhnlich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Flota en el aire gracias a la electricidad almacenada en su cuerpo. Con nubarrones de tormenta, lo hace a mayor altura de lo habitual.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fluttua grazie all’elettricità immagazzinata nel suo corpo. Quando in cielo compaiono nubi temporalesche fluttua più in alto del solito.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It floats using the electricity stored in its body. When thunderclouds are around, Tadbulb will float higher off the ground.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体に　蓄えた　電力で　浮遊する。雷雲のときは　いつもより高く　浮き上がるのだ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会靠储存在体内的电力来浮在空中。出现雷云时能比平时浮得更高。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
